# DropPanel — Amazon→eBay Dropshipping SaaS
# Cursor için proje bağlamı ve kurallar

## PROJE TANIMI
DropPanel, Amazon ürünlerini eBay'de otomatik listeleyen bir dropshipping SaaS platformudur.
Tek workspace, çok mağaza (S1, S2, S3, S4) desteği vardır.

## TEKNOLOJİ STACK
- Backend: Node.js + TypeScript (strict mode) + Express
- Panel: Next.js 14 + TailwindCSS
- DB: PostgreSQL 18
- Queue: BullMQ + Redis (planned)
- eBay API: Inventory API, Account API, Fulfillment API
- AI: Claude API (Anthropic)

## KRİTİK KURALLAR

### TypeScript
- Strict mode zorunlu
- `any` tip kullanma
- Her fonksiyon için return type yaz
- Tam dosya yaz, parça kod verme

### Dosya Yapısı
```
backend/
  modules/
    admin/           → adminRoutes.ts, adminService.ts, adminTypes.ts
    asinImport/      → asinImportService.ts, asinImportTypes.ts
    dispatch/        → dispatchService.ts, dispatchTypes.ts
    ebay/            → ebayApiClient.ts, ebayApiTypes.ts, ebayInventoryService.ts, ebayPayloadService.ts
    ebayOAuth/       → ebayOAuthService.ts, ebayOAuthTypes.ts
    monitor/         → monitorService.ts, monitorTypes.ts
    monitorActions/  → monitorActionsService.ts, monitorActionsTypes.ts
    publishQueue/    → publishQueueService.ts, publishQueueTypes.ts, publishQueueRepository.ts
    publishGuard/    → publishGuardService.ts, publishGuardTypes.ts
    pricing/         → pricingService.ts
    storeSettings/   → storeSettingsService.ts, storeSettingsRepository.ts, storeSettingsTypes.ts
    stores/          → storeRepository.ts
    pool/            → poolRepository.ts
    registry/        → registryRepository.ts
    scheduler/       → schedulerService.ts
    worker/          → workerService.ts
    runtime/         → runtimeService.ts
    templates/       → templateService.ts, templateTypes.ts
    http/            → httpServer.ts, httpTypes.ts
    db/              → client.ts
  server.ts
  start-worker-loop.ts
panel/
  src/
    app/             → Next.js pages (import, dashboard, queue, history, stores, monitor, pool, dispatch)
    components/      → layout/Sidebar.tsx, layout/Topbar.tsx, ui/
    lib/             → api.ts
```

### SKU FORMAT
```
YENİ format (alphanumeric): DP{ASIN}{STORESCODE}
Örnek: DPB071251380S1

ESKİ format (legacy): DP-{ASIN}-{STORESCODE}
Örnek: DP-B071251380-S1

eBay SKU'da tire (-) KULLANMA — sadece alphanumeric
```

### SIMULATION MODE
```typescript
// .env
EBAY_SIMULATION=true   // fake eBay, gerçek DB
EBAY_SIMULATION=false  // gerçek eBay API

// Kod içinde kontrol
const simulation = (process.env.EBAY_SIMULATION ?? "true") !== "false"

// monitorService içinde
const simMode = ebayConfig.simulationMode !== false
```

### DATABASE
```
Workspace ID: 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001
Stores: S1(id=2), S2(id=3), S3(id=4), S4(id=5)

Tablolar:
- workspaces
- stores
- store_settings
- asin_registry
- asin_pool
- amazon_product_cache
- ai_listing_cache
- listing_history
- ebay_accounts
```

### PIPELINE AKIŞI
```
ASIN Import
  → asin_registry + asin_pool (validated, pending)
  → amazon_product_cache (scraper/extension)
  → ai_listing_cache (Claude AI)
  → eBay payload (pricing + template)
  → Publish Guard (score check)
  → eBay Inventory API
  → listing_history
```

### FİYATLANDIRMA
```
P = C × (1 + margin) / (1 - fee - tax)

Rule engine:
< $15    → %35 margin
$15-40   → %25 margin
$40-100  → %18 margin
$100+    → %15 margin
```

